@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245200452",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200452-hub/CNTTK23C"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop vua tao (Buoc 12) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Doc luot nop khong ton tai (Buoc 12) -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6. Nop bai thieu studentCode -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200452-hub/CNTTK23C"
}
